    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "So, it settles a little with resting. I'd say mild. And there's ankle swelling in the evenings as well, three weeks now.",
