    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Moderate, really. I've had breathlessness on slopes too, for six months. With breathlessness on slopes, I'd give it a four, out of ten.",
